{"id":"2122033244627689692","url":"https://x.com/Saboo_Shubham_/status/2122033244627689692","handle":"Saboo_Shubham_","name":"Shubham Saboo","followers":124580,"verified":true,"createdAt":"2026-11-15T18:25:25.000Z","lang":"en","text":"This is INSANE.\n\nI just reprogrammed my TV yesterday using Gemini 4 Carbon in Antigravity with an open-source agent.md file.\n\nClean, personalized UI with no ads or clutter. And it's way faster.\n\nYou can NOW do crazy stuff in a few hours.","links":[],"views":53814,"likes":570,"replies":51,"reposts":17,"quotes":5,"bookmarks":289,"conversationId":"2122033244627689692","quoted":null,"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXL2raTawAAFSpV.jpg","width":3559,"height":2262}],"seed":false,"via":"daily","checkedAt":"2026-11-17T01:27:38.953Z"},
